Privacy Policy — Bubble Shooter
Last updated: August 20, 2026
Bubble Shooter ("the App") is developed by Emeraldys ("we," "us," "our"). This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information in connection with your use of the App.
Summary
Bubble Shooter does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data. The App does not use third-party analytics, advertising SDKs, or tracking tools. There are no user accounts. All gameplay data stays on your device.
Information We Collect
We do not collect any information about you or your device. Specifically:
* No account or sign-in is required to use the App.
* No personal information (name, email, location, contacts, etc.) is requested or collected.
* No analytics or crash-reporting SDKs are integrated into the App.
* No advertising SDKs are integrated into the App, and no ads are shown.
* No data is transmitted to us or to any third party by the App.
Data Stored on Your Device
The App stores the following locally on your device only, using standard iOS/watchOS storage:
* Game progress (levels completed, scores)
* Survival Mode high scores
* App settings and preferences
This local data is never uploaded, synced to a server, or shared with us or any third party. It stays on your device and is removed if you delete the App.
Leaderboards
Any in-app leaderboard or high-score display reflects scores stored locally on your own device and is not shared with other players or transmitted off-device.
In-App Purchases
Bubble Shooter is a paid, one-time-purchase app. It contains no in-app purchases, subscriptions, or advertising.
Children's Privacy
Because the App collects no personal data of any kind, it does not knowingly collect information from children under 13 (or the relevant age of digital consent in your region). The App is appropriate for use by children under the guidance of a parent or guardian, consistent with the App Store's age rating for the App.
Third-Party Services
The App does not integrate any third-party SDKs, services, or frameworks that collect data (no analytics, no advertising networks, no social integrations).
Changes to This Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time, for example to reflect new features. Any changes will be posted at this same URL with an updated "Last updated" date. Continued use of the App after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.
